message: "Please cite this bounded stateful evidence-audit study and its reproducible empirical artifacts."
title: "When Can a Swarm Be Audited?"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Sacara
    given-names: Razvan
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3172-2476
repository-code: "https://github.com/razzyrazzy11/swarm-alignment"
version: "results-v1"
date-released: 2026-11-06
abstract: "Finite-world evidence oracle and completed empirical study: 3,840 Adaption reader calls over 192 source draws, 240 matched Hugging Face reader calls on 24 shared sources, and a separate 216-call model-worker influence extension. The primary increase in unsupported executor accusations was not supported. Schema-informed authentic restoration helped the Adaption readers but showed limited cross-reader transfer. Public fake-data cases support offline score and aggregate replay. An explicitly registered operational continuation and earlier failed qualifications/providers remain disclosed; no deployment safety or spontaneous-collusion claim is made."
